Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:33.40,TS/Fiction_Disclaimer,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(277,260)\blur3}This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on\N are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:37.22,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,This whistle... It must be Lihaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.24,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,He must have successfully \Ngotten Maomao out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.98,0:01:41.80,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Basen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:43.70,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,No need to be so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:46.41,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,Then please, let me take the vanguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.88,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Wait, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:55.88,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,Feifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:56.63,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:57.76,Default,Kanzan,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.10,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Where is Shishou?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:08.37,Default,Kanzan,0,0,0,,I-I don't know! We were all tricked!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.13,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,What a brazen lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:13.90,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,We already have evidence that you embezzled\N treasury funds for this stronghold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.67,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,You must know what that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:19.31,Default,Kanzan,0,0,0,,We were told it was for the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:22.25,Default,Kanzan,0,0,0,,We were only doing it for the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:26.12,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,How gentle of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.84,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,If he's bound to be executed anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:36.60,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,You should just finish him off swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:37.17,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,Shishou!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.23,0:02:42.46,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,You seem quite calm, Shishou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:45.43,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,The emperor's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.89,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,You are under arrest for\N embezzlement and rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:54.23,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,It's obvious that the emperor made his order, \Nsince the royal guard is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.69,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Have you gone senile? \NIt doesn't even have a lit match!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.08,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:10.03,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,How pathetic. You were playfully \Nshooting at beasts in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:14.05,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,You were so eager to test it \Non humans, as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:15.25,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,Too bad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.28,Default,Kanzan,0,0,0,,I-I never said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.77,Default,Soldier B,0,0,0,,Without a lit match?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:22.38,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,It's the latest model. \NIt can fire without a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:24.72,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,Oh yes, of course you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.81,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,I was attacked by one, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:31.60,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,That was so close. If only \NI'd successfully killed you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:34.61,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,Honestly, it was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:37.48,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's the end, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:40.49,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,If only I had a bit more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:44.16,Default,Shishou,0,0,0,,Or not. Maybe it wouldn't have helped at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:45.78,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:48.95,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,It's like he's reciting a prepared script...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:52.96,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:33.08,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,It's like I'm watching a play\Nstaged by Shishou, an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.49,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,The emperor's closest retainer, \Nthere since the last emperor's era,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:40.59,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,and a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:42.84,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Abrupt? Disappointing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:45.40,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Either could describe his final moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.35,top,Woman 1,0,0,0,,We didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:51.86,Ep_Title,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,470)\fsp1.5\blur3}Episode 47: The Shi Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.97,top,Woman 2,0,0,0,,Shenmei and Loulan are in the room in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:53.99,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:54.77,Default,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:01.44,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Check that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:02.43,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:17.94,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:20.50,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Loulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:23.28,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Greetings, Moon Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:27.89,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Actually, let me call you \NMaster Jinshi, for convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:31.90,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Could you please follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:33.39,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,And if I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:36.32,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,That's why I'm threatening you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:40.98,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You're actually going to \Nobediently follow, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:44.28,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,You're the one that demanded it of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:49.39,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,But it would be easy for you \Nto get this away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:54.29,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:06:00.29,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Suirei, my dear sister, \Nhas she stopped abusing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.84,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,So, this is Suirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:07.13,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,She seduced a doctor, and feigned \Nbeing a corpse to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:10.33,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Then she returned, \Nunder the guise of a eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.90,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,I thought she was a bold, daring woman, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:17.60,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Loulan, that man... Could he be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:21.61,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I asked him to accompany me here\Nto make your wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:27.93,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You've always hated him, haven't you? \NThe person who looked just like that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:32.03,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Were you perhaps jealous that he was \Nmuch more beautiful than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:37.08,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Or perhaps because he chose the \Nlady-in-waiting much younger than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:41.55,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Although he never visited you, \Nhis high-ranking concubine, in your room...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:42.96,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Loulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.71,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I guess that's enough teasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:52.34,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Now, before we allow you to fulfill your \Nwish, let's have some entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.89,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,This story goes back more than 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:01.77,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,The late emperor was a fool, who could \Nnot speak up against his mother at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:06.29,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,So, the mother was the one\N wielding the true power,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:08.78,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,and people referred to her \Nas "the Empress" behind her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:13.78,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,The empress regnant grew impatient with\N her son, who showed no interest in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:17.00,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,She sent every beauty she could \Nfind into the rear palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:19.96,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Then, one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:21.65,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,Shenmei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:25.96,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,I heard you're going to\N the rear palace. Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:29.05,flashback,Young Shenmei,0,0,0,,Yes! They practically begged me \Nto become a high concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.05,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,But I... We were going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:34.28,flashback,Young Shenmei,0,0,0,,That deal is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.13,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:37.97,flashback,Young Shenmei,0,0,0,,Don't you get it? This is a golden opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:42.54,flashback,Young Shenmei,0,0,0,,If I can get pregnant in the rear palace, \NI could even become empress dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:47.57,flashback,Young Shenmei,0,0,0,,I can't be stuck here as the wife of \Na local lord in these northern outskirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:49.97,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,Shenmei...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:53.69,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Inviting you to become \Nher son's high concubine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:56.58,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,That was just a front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:08:00.27,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,A front? What are you saying, Loulan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.37,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,They practically begged me to—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:06.64,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Perhaps that's how it seemed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:11.74,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,When my grandfather was dying in his bed, \Nhe squeezed one thing out, like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:15.38,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,That there was nothing he could do, \Nnow that his daughter was held hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.38,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.66,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Taking the daughter of \Na high official as a hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:22.31,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,while outwardly referring to her \Nas a concubine, is quite common.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.40,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Father gave up on you once, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:31.90,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,But something completely\N unexpected happened:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.69,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,The late emperor's inclinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:39.10,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Master Jinshi. Do you know the reason \Nwhy the rear palace grew so large?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:42.54,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,I heard that Shishou convinced \Nthe empress regnant to expand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:48.51,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Yes, he suggested the expansion of \Nthe rear palace as a new public project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:50.88,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,To replace the slave trade, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.34,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Slave... trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:58.41,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Mother, you are truly ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:02.24,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,About what Grandfather did to draw \Nthe attention of the empress regnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:05.06,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,But slavery was legal back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:09.15,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I hear they were treated similarly \Nto pleasure district courtesans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:13.71,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,However, that was not always the case \Nfor slaves sold to other nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:18.75,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,That's why the empress regnant\N banned the slave trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:21.76,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,The Shi clan, with their daughter held hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:25.61,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,had no choice but to cut down on slave \Ntrading, which was their family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:31.75,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,When Grandfather felt like he was out of \Noptions, Father came and suggested this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:36.80,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,Why don't we use the rear palace \Nas a place to send the leftover slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.96,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,Young women could serve \Nas servants and court ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:42.72,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,while men could serve there as eunuchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:46.01,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,Expanding the rear palace could be\N sold to the empress regnant
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:49.56,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,as an idea to get the emperor \Nto take an interest in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:52.57,flashback,Clan Elder,0,0,0,,You're right. Also, the families \Nwho sold off their daughters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:57.66,flashback,Clan Elder,0,0,0,,would feel less guilt if their girls went to \Nthe rear palace, instead of a foreign land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.28,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.18,flashback,Young Shishou,0,0,0,,It's a win for everyone involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:06.18,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Father tried to earn the trust\N of the empress regnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:11.71,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,so that he could restore the status of the Shi \Nclan, and get you, the hostage, released.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.84,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You were so troublesome, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:19.55,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,To think, this would all have been simpler \Nif you had escaped back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:27.73,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,Shishou?! How did you get here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:29.44,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,I built a secret path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:33.08,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,Shenmei, let's run away together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:33.82,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.39,0:10:37.32,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,If you desire it, we can run away together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:40.61,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,Leaving the rear palace is a serious crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:43.20,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,Building a secret path \Nis already a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.76,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,I couldn't give up on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:49.69,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,I couldn't accept having anyone \Nother than you as my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.58,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,I couldn't resist coming to see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:55.74,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,Are you sure I'm good enough for you—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:56.83,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:10:59.59,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:12.73,flashback italics,Low-Rank Concubine A,0,0,0,,Is that the "high-ranked" concubine who \Nlost to her lady-in-waiting, Taihou?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:16.20,flashback italics,Low-Rank Concubine B,0,0,0,,To think she entered before Lady Anshi did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:19.40,flashback italics,Low-Rank Concubine C,0,0,0,,I heard she hasn't ever received \Na nightly visit, even once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.82,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,Don't insult me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:25.03,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,You want me to run away, ashamed and insulted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:25.99,flashback,Adult Shishou,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:26.99,flashback,Adult Shenmei,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:35.29,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You couldn't trust the man who would \Nthrow away his status just to be with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:39.30,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,There's no way I could have trusted that fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.87,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,He took over the family immediately \Nafter my father fell ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.81,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,and took this girl's mother as a wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:51.78,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Excuse me, my dear sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:57.52,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,What?! Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.98,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,A phoenix hair stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:03.05,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Yes. You know this too, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:07.41,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,The only ones who can wear \Nthis symbol, alongside the kirin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.75,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,are those who carry imperial lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:13.84,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Lies! The late emperor never admitted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.97,0:12:18.11,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,It seems he felt guilty the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:21.79,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,He was worried about the baby \Nhe threw out of the rear palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:25.84,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Apparently, he came to see her \Noccasionally, with help from Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:31.97,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,He did deny it once, but he \Nknew she was his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:34.35,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,That's why he asked Father, \Nwho was single at the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:38.44,flashback,Late Emperor,0,0,0,,I want you to take my daughter as your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.81,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Father accepted the daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:45.20,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,born between the emperor and \Nyour lady-in-waiting as his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:49.22,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,And later, a child was born between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:52.50,flashback,Shishou,0,0,0,,I've named her Shisui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:57.02,flashback,Late Emperor,0,0,0,,Shisui... A good name for \Na member of the Shi clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:13:01.00,flashback,Shishou,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you told me \Nyou would grant me a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:07.01,flashback,Shishou,0,0,0,,May I have Shenmei, \Nthe high-ranking concubine, as a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:11.61,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,With the "Shi" name given to his grandchild, \Nthe late emperor was relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:14.18,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,He no longer felt it necessary \Nto hold a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:17.90,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,And thus, you were bestowed\N upon Father, as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.71,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,The late emperor was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:26.05,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,He had no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:30.83,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,what effect his selfish wishes would have \Non his own daughter, and on Shishou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:33.62,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Lies! Lies, all lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.04,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,All of it, utter nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:37.18,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Nonsense, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:40.92,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Father did everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:44.22,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Even knowing that, in the end, \Nit would all end in catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:51.39,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Don't you even see why \NMaster Jinshi is here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.76,0:13:55.14,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,How were Father's final moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.22,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,He died laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:02.54,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,All that man ever wanted \Nwas power for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:04.00,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,He only took me as his wife
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:06.53,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,in order to flaunt his position\N as leader of this clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:12.46,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,But once the dust settled, it was you, \NMother, who took control of our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:19.37,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Do you know what the clan members \Nwho suck up to you did at the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:22.59,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Are you referring to the embezzlement?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.52,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Yes. They took part \Nin all manner of corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:31.18,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,The sane ones who spoke up against it \Nwere ousted, so only the rot remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:34.99,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Father took on the role \Nof the traitor to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:38.94,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,every rotten element of the Shi clan \Nin one explosive catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:43.70,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Master Jinshi. People referred \Nto my father as a scheming tanuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.94,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,but did you know tanukis are \Nactually very timid creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:50.74,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,That's why they try to trick others. \NTheir lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:54.75,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,If what she's saying is true, \NI should have separated the two issues...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:57.38,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,The expansion of the rear palace \Nand the embezzlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.22,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Shishou played the role \Nof the necessary evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:02.74,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,to gather all of the rot \Nin the nation in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:04.75,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,But for this, he'll see no reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:09.13,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Did my father adequately fulfill \Nhis role as the evil mastermind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:13.35,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Is there any proof that all you've said is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:17.96,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,The palace rot should \Nmostly be cleaned out by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.37,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Did you know for certain \Nthat this would all work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:24.43,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,If it hadn't, we could have \Nsimply taken over the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:27.57,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,If the nation is that weak, \Nit doesn't deserve to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:31.53,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,You and that man both were \Ntricking me this whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:35.44,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I merely did as you ordered, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:39.53,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You said it yourself: this nation \Ndeserves to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.43,0:15:44.14,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You surrounded yourself \Nwith smooth-talking idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:48.21,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Did you really think you could defeat \Nthe royal guard that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.71,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Loulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:56.47,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,That's why I had these made!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:59.93,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You can't handle it. Give it back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.69,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.10,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.35,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Oh, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.83,0:16:09.07,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,You're so insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:10.90,Default,Shenmei,0,0,0,,Loulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:16.03,Default,Basen,0,0,0,,A gunshot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:17.67,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Master Basen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:25.79,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I'm such a bad daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:30.55,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Were I true to my father's intentions, \NI would never have done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.08,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,You blocked it so it would backfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:36.44,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,This new model has a complex build.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:41.18,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Didn't you think of taking it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:43.80,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,It would have been easy for you, \Nwith the right timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:46.10,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,You had something you wanted to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.86,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Oh, if only you were just \Nan idiot with a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:17:00.33,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Mother, Father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:02.79,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Won't you at least shed a single tear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:06.41,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,He waited for you most of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:11.19,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,If only you had a tear to shed for him, \NI wouldn't have had to do any of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:15.91,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Was there no other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:22.07,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Perhaps there was. \NBut we just aren't that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:27.49,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Shenmei wanted to tear down the nation \Nthat kept making a mockery of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:31.05,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Shishou wanted to do \Neverything for Shenmei,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.27,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,but was also a loyal retainer \Nwho couldn't let go of the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:35.89,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Master Jinshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.77,0:17:41.66,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I know this is a lot to ask, but I have \Ntwo favors I would like from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:43.91,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.00,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:50.80,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,First, please take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:59.28,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,My original plan was to use that \Nas leverage to beg for my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:01.26,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,but I guess that didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:06.32,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Written there are things that could \Nhappen to this nation from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:10.00,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,My first wish is this:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:12.77,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Clan members who can think rationally
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:15.15,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,have all been ousted by \Nmy mother and lost their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.86,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,My sister's situation is similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:24.26,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,As they have already died once, \Nwould you consider sparing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:25.55,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:29.90,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,So, you'll let those who've died once go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.21,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:33.44,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,What's the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.47,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Well, here is my other wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:04.24,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:09.54,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,Mother, this is the best I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:23.68,Default,Loulan,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can be a better \Nactor than my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:01.68,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,980)}Should I have stopped her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:04.71,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,980)}No, I couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:08.66,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,980)}The final performance of \Na once-in-a-generation evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.08,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,980)}There was no way I could ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:15.18,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,980)}Nor could I avert my gaze from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:57.87,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,That was the last I ever saw of Loulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.59,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,My body feels so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:12.11,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I haven't slept \Nmuch at all over the past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:14.14,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,How's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:15.40,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,She is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:17.85,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Please, you must rest a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.35,0:22:19.56,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:23.04,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,960)}You shouldn't get too close...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:32.26,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,The dead children of the Shi clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:35.05,top,Jinshi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,220)}Why is she sleeping here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.05,0:22:38.54,top,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,220)}She begged me to allow her, I couldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:42.54,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,She's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.99,0:22:44.70,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,As are you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:51.55,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,I knew the cut on my face would cause \Na subordinate to get punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:56.06,italics,Jinshi,0,0,0,,But I still accepted Loulan's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:57.67,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:01.99,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,We should be glad \Nthe strategist isn't here, right?
